~ pick_up_lollipop
A broken lollipop
A flat circle of sugar. Rainbow, mostly gray now.
Do you want to take this as an offering? Or look some more?
- Pick up
	do pick_up()
	The wrapper sticks to your thumb.
	do AudioManager.current_speaker = AudioManager.narrator
	NARRATOR: Yes. Candy. Predictable. I adore predictable.
	do AudioManager.current_speaker = AudioManager.eye
	do GlobalSignals.eye_talking.emit(true)
	???: (pleased telepathically) Sweet is small sunshine.
	do GlobalSignals.eye_talking.emit(false)
	if player.inventory.items.size() == 0
		do AudioManager.current_speaker = AudioManager.narrator
		NARRATOR: I am sorry did… did that thing just speak inside your mind?
		NARRATOR: I’m doing the same thing? That is besides the point.
		do AudioManager.current_speaker = null
	=> END!
- Leave alone
	do AudioManager.current_speaker = AudioManager.narrator
	NARRATOR: Do you think someone will be back to claim it?
	NARRATOR: Or do you  just want it all to yourself?
	=> END!
do AudioManager.current_speaker = null
=> END!
